# Rotation coverage — the same polarised symbol in all four quarter
# turns (the value label spells the rotation), plus a few vertical
# two-terminal bodies and a rotated transistor.
circuit Rotations

diode  4  3  r0    D1  r0
diode 12  3  r90   D2  r90
diode 20  3  r180  D3  r180
diode 28  3  r270  D4  r270

resistor   4 11  v  R1  vertical
capacitor 12 11  v  C1  vertical
inductor  20 11  v  L1  vertical
npn       28 11  v  Q1  r90
